          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><em>Rooted in India. Crafted with Purpose.  Shared with the World.</em></h3><h3></h3><p>Welcome to <strong>Sheer Roots</strong>, a celebration of India's diverse heritage, craftsmanship and the timeless traditions that continue to shape the way we create and live.</p><p>We believe that Indian craftsmanship is not simply about making beautiful objects. It is about <strong>knowledge passed through generations, skilled hands, cultural identity and stories waiting to be carried forward</strong>.</p><p>At Sheer Roots, we thoughtfully bring together Indian handicrafts, traditional products, artisanal creations and contemporary interpretations of Indian culture—connecting the richness of our roots with the way the world lives today.</p><p>Our journey is guided by a simple belief:</p><p><strong>Every piece has a story. And every story deserves to be carried forward.</strong></p>",
