        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><em>A Thought Rooted in India</em></h3><p>Sheer Roots began with a desire to reconnect everyday living with the richness of Indian craftsmanship.</p><p>India has always been home to extraordinary artisans, traditional techniques and artistic traditions. Yet, in a world increasingly shaped by mass production, many of these skills and stories risk becoming distant from everyday life.</p><p>We wanted to create a platform that could help bridge that gap.</p><p>Our approach is simple—<strong>discover, curate and bring Indian craftsmanship into contemporary spaces</strong>, while respecting the people, skills and traditions behind every creation.</p><p>Through our journey, we aim to work with artisans and craft communities, creating opportunities for their skills to reach new audiences while contributing to meaningful livelihoods.</p><p>From traditional handicrafts to contemporary products inspired by India's cultural vocabulary, Sheer Roots is our way of keeping the connection alive.</p><p><strong>From the hands that create to the homes and lives that receive—Sheer Roots is about creating that connection.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
