        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4><em>To Keep India's Craft Alive, Relevant and Connected to the World.</em></h4><p>Our vision is to see Indian craftsmanship appreciated not only as a tradition of the past, but as a <strong>living part of contemporary life</strong>.</p><p>We aspire to build a thoughtfully curated platform where Indian artisans, traditional techniques and meaningful design can find a place in modern homes, lifestyles and gifting.</p><p>We envision a future where:</p><p><strong>Traditional skills continue to thrive.<br/>Artisans have opportunities to grow.<br/>Indian craftsmanship reaches wider audiences.<br/><br/>And every thoughtfully chosen product carries a sense of heritage and purpose.</strong></p><p>Our ambition is to take the richness of India <strong>from its roots to the world</strong>, while remaining respectful of where every creation begins.</p>"
