            "text": "<h3><em>Thoughtfully Chosen. Meaningfully Created.</em></h3><p>At Sheer Roots, we promise to approach every product with <strong>care, curiosity and respect</strong>.</p><p>We strive to:</p><p><strong>Celebrate Authenticity</strong><br/>Respect the cultural inspiration, traditional techniques and stories behind the products we bring to you.</p><p><strong>Value Craftsmanship</strong><br/>Recognize the skill, patience and human effort involved in handmade creation.</p><p><strong>Choose with Purpose</strong><br/>Select products not simply because they are beautiful, but because they carry meaning, craftsmanship or cultural value.</p><p><strong>Respect Materials</strong><br/>Pay attention to the materials that become part of our everyday lives and appreciate their natural character and integrity.</p><p><strong>Support Artisan Livelihoods</strong><br/>Wherever possible, create opportunities that help artisans and craft communities sustain their skills and livelihoods.</p><p><strong>Bring Tradition into Today</strong><br/>Present India's rich craft heritage in ways that feel relevant, useful and beautiful in contemporary life.</p>",
